WEBVTT

00:13:59.596 --> 00:14:01.276
it comes from the same word,

00:14:01.316 --> 00:14:02.596
from the same root,

00:14:02.596 --> 00:14:04.156
as the word for passion.

00:14:05.076 --> 00:14:08.156
The place you suffer
is the same exact place

00:14:08.196 --> 00:14:10.236
where you care desperately.

00:14:10.276 --> 00:14:14.716
It's the same place that inspires you
to ease someone's pain however you can.

00:14:14.716 --> 00:14:16.796
And it's the place that you vibrate

00:14:16.796 --> 00:14:19.596
with the insane beauty of this world.

00:14:19.596 --> 00:14:23.676
So, remember, there's light
and there's dark.

00:14:23.676 --> 00:14:25.796
And when the dark times come,

00:14:25.796 --> 00:14:27.396
and they will come,

00:14:27.436 --> 00:14:29.156
don't be surprised,

00:14:29.196 --> 00:14:32.876
but ask yourself:
What are you longing for?